{{also|libelle|libellé}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{der|de|NL.|lībellula}}, coined by {{w|Carl von Linné}} after {{m|la|lībella|t=carpenter's level}}, because of the insect's ability to stay level when hovering. {{m+|de||Libelle}} is a shortened form, in part after the underlying Latin noun. {{doublet|de|Niveau|Level}}.

